--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line 35 using-declared member of private TT base: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
A class template privately inherits (class default access) from a
template-template-parameter base and republishes a base member with a
public using-declaration (N5008 [namespace.udecl]/16,19).  Calling the
member on a derived lvalue must bind the implicit object argument to
the private base ([over.match.funcs]/5) -- the libc++
__split_buffer/__relocate shape whose rejection made vector's
__emplace_back_slow_path bodiless.
